WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:12.710
Chechnya is an island of islamic fanaticism
in the middle of Vladimir Putin’s Russia.

00:00:12.710 --> 00:00:13.710
Yup.

00:00:13.710 --> 00:00:14.710
You heard that right.

00:00:14.710 --> 00:00:19.490
In a country that congratulates itself on
being the Spiritual Shelter of the West, the

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:24.250
last bulwark of Christianity… that is the
country where the Republic of Chechnya is.

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:31.240
A part of Russia where vodka is impossible
to buy...

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:33.270
And yes, I know what you are gonna say…

00:00:33.270 --> 00:00:35.989
‘Oh, Simon, did you just say the REPUBLIC
of CHECHNYA?

00:00:35.989 --> 00:00:38.440
Didn’t you say it was part of Russia?’

00:00:38.440 --> 00:00:42.769
The truth is, the Russian Federation is, territory
wise, the biggest country in the World.

00:00:42.769 --> 00:00:46.660
And that means their political distribution
is really complicated…

00:00:46.660 --> 00:00:50.570
The biggest part of the country is divided
into the so-called OBLASTs, which are similar

00:00:50.570 --> 00:00:53.800
to the states of the United States of America.

00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:58.150
They have their own governor, their own parliament,
but they must respect the Russian constitution

00:00:58.150 --> 00:00:59.610
and the Kremlin.

00:00:59.610 --> 00:01:04.799
However, there are other regions in Russia,
the so-called, REPUBLICS, that have way more

00:01:04.799 --> 00:01:05.799
autonomy.

00:01:05.799 --> 00:01:14.360
They have their own constitution, their own
language, and even their own official religion.

00:01:14.360 --> 00:01:17.180
One of those republics is the Crimean Republic.

00:01:17.180 --> 00:01:21.970
And despite not being recognized by America,
or by Europe, it is controlled by Russia.

00:01:21.970 --> 00:01:23.190
You see, ‘in theory’

00:01:23.190 --> 00:01:26.140
(fingers) Russian law guarantees a lot of
autonomy.

00:01:26.140 --> 00:01:31.830
But I say ‘in theory’ because as you know,
Vladimir Putin loves to keep his country under

00:01:31.830 --> 00:01:33.500
tight control.

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:39.470
In fact, almost all of the presidents of the
republics belong to Putin’s political party:

00:01:39.470 --> 00:01:40.470
UNITED RUSSIA.

00:01:40.470 --> 00:01:46.060
Anytime one of those governments challenges
Putin even a little, things like this happen:

00:01:46.060 --> 00:01:52.751
Tatarstan, the Last Region to Lose Its Special
Status Under Putin Nonetheless, there is a

00:01:52.751 --> 00:01:54.690
republic Putin doesn’t dare bully.

00:01:54.690 --> 00:01:56.500
Yep, you heard that right.

00:01:56.500 --> 00:02:01.610
Vladimir Putin, the Chuck Norris of politics,
is afraid sometimes, too.

00:02:01.610 --> 00:02:04.240
Specifically when it comes to CHECHNYA.

00:02:04.240 --> 00:02:07.659
‘It is often unclear who rules whom.

00:02:07.659 --> 00:02:14.260
Russian observers of the region complain that
Russian law and authority stops at the Chechen

00:02:14.260 --> 00:02:22.920
border’ For example in Chechnya, the hijab
is promoted by the government.

00:02:22.920 --> 00:02:27.930
Things like polygamy or even marriages involving
minors are tolerated…

00:02:27.930 --> 00:02:32.750
And no restaurant dares to open at daytime
during the Ramadan season.

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:37.510
Nonetheless, all of these things are nothing
compared to what some newspapers showed in

00:02:37.510 --> 00:02:41.680
April, 2017.

00:02:41.680 --> 00:02:46.560
‘Chechnya opens world's first concentration
camp for homosexuals’

00:02:46.560 --> 00:02:48.270
Yes, yes, I know…

00:02:48.270 --> 00:02:54.670
Putin is no big fan of LGBT rights… but
opening a gay concentration camp sounds a

00:02:54.670 --> 00:02:57.209
bit too much, even for him.

00:02:57.209 --> 00:02:58.900
So the question to be made here is…

00:02:58.900 --> 00:03:01.890
Why doesn’t Putin dare to put some order
in Chechnya?

00:03:01.890 --> 00:03:07.350
What is the Chechnyan president, RAMZAN KADYROV’s
secret to getting Putin to let him do as he

00:03:07.350 --> 00:03:08.350
pleases?

00:03:08.350 --> 00:03:11.651
Today, we are going to answer all of those
questions but before we do, let’s take a

00:03:11.651 --> 00:03:13.770
look back
at the history...

00:03:13.770 --> 00:03:19.190
THE SICILY OF THE CAUCASUS

00:03:19.190 --> 00:03:24.470
For centuries, Chechnya was ruled by big clans
that had power over specific areas.

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:29.730
Those clans, named TUKKHUM in the Chechen
language, were composed of hundreds of smaller

00:03:29.730 --> 00:03:32.050
families, the so called TEIP.

00:03:32.050 --> 00:03:36.970
For a better understanding, this was pretty
similar to the Sicilian mafia system: everything

00:03:36.970 --> 00:03:40.680
stayed in the families.

00:03:40.680 --> 00:03:46.129
And everything was done according to the principles
of religion, in this case, SUNNI ISLAM.

00:03:46.129 --> 00:03:51.470
And, the same way the Sicilian mafia resisted
all kinds of invasions, the Chechen TUKKHUM

00:03:51.470 --> 00:03:55.300
system survived the Tzars and even the Soviet
Union.

00:03:55.300 --> 00:04:00.870
‘We must be Soviets in public and Muslims
in private’ Chechen proverb.

00:04:00.870 --> 00:04:06.030
In other words, during the Soviet era, there
were two parallel systems running at the same

00:04:06.030 --> 00:04:07.030
time.

00:04:07.030 --> 00:04:08.599
On the surface, there was communism.

00:04:08.599 --> 00:04:13.239
Underground, there was this hierarchy of Muslim
clans and families.

00:04:13.239 --> 00:04:18.750
This is why, when, in the year 1991, the Soviet
Union disappeared, Chechens seized the opportunity

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:21.850
and declared the CHECHEN REPUBLIC OF ICHKERIA.

00:04:21.850 --> 00:04:27.350
This name might ring a bell because it appeared
in one of the CALL OF DUTY video games by

00:04:27.350 --> 00:04:30.800
the way!

00:04:30.800 --> 00:04:35.740
Back then, the President of the brand new
Russian Federation, BORIS YELTSIN, replied

00:04:35.740 --> 00:04:40.509
to those rebels with military power.

00:04:40.509 --> 00:04:45.669
Yeltsin declares emergency, curfew in Chechen
region Nevertheless, this state of emergency

00:04:45.669 --> 00:04:47.169
failed entirely.

00:04:47.169 --> 00:04:52.830
The Russian army was incapable of stopping
the Chechen rebels and had to run back home.

00:04:52.830 --> 00:04:54.449
But not only that!

00:04:54.449 --> 00:04:57.970
During their retreat, the separatist rebels
seized Russian weapons.

00:04:57.970 --> 00:05:01.860
So for three long years, the Kremlin had to
put up with Chechnya.

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:07.969
But, in the year 1994, things changed.

00:05:07.969 --> 00:05:15.300
“You can build a throne with bayonets, but
it's difficult to sit on it” –Boris Yeltsin

00:05:15.300 --> 00:05:18.629
Do you remember what I told you about the
political system of Chechnya, based on the

00:05:18.629 --> 00:05:20.129
TUKKHUM clan system?

00:05:20.129 --> 00:05:25.059
Well… the truth is, those different clams
didn’t really get on well with each other.

00:05:25.059 --> 00:05:27.169
And this is how a civil war started.

00:05:27.169 --> 00:05:31.819
A civil war that, to Russian eyes, was the
perfect opportunity to take back control of

00:05:31.819 --> 00:05:32.819
the republic.

00:05:32.819 --> 00:05:36.490
However, a year later, after the Russian army
had lost almost 6,000 soldiers, poor Boris

00:05:36.490 --> 00:05:41.259
Yeltsin had to sign a peace treaty with the
separatist and pretty weak government of Chechnya.

00:05:41.259 --> 00:05:46.339
Meanwhile, many Islamic terrorists from Saudi
Arabia and Afghanistan fled to Grozny, the

00:05:46.339 --> 00:05:48.400
Chechen capital, to recruit new members.

00:05:48.400 --> 00:05:53.009
A failed state with a tribal system where
Islam is the official religion sounds like

00:05:53.009 --> 00:06:02.680
a great market for terrorist recruiting, now
doesn’t it?

00:06:02.680 --> 00:06:04.099
In other words…

00:06:04.099 --> 00:06:07.979
it was just a matter of time before another
war started.

00:06:07.979 --> 00:06:13.469
This actually happened in 1999, when a group
if Islamic rebels invaded a neighbouring Russian

00:06:13.469 --> 00:06:15.539
republic: the republic of DAGESTAN.

00:06:15.539 --> 00:06:20.149
So, if making trouble in their own territory
wasn’t enough, Chechens wanted to attack

00:06:20.149 --> 00:06:21.699
other parts of Russia.

00:06:21.699 --> 00:06:26.800
As you can imagine, the Kremlin had to send
their troops immediately.

00:06:26.800 --> 00:06:28.800
But this time it was different…

00:06:28.800 --> 00:06:29.800
Why?

00:06:29.800 --> 00:06:32.909
Well…
despite Boris Yeltsin being the president,

00:06:32.909 --> 00:06:38.419
this time, the Prime Minister was… the one,
the only, the hero of VisualPolitik…

00:06:38.419 --> 00:06:42.889
VLADIMIR PUTIN!

00:06:42.889 --> 00:06:49.099
Putin went there and found one of the separatist
chiefs, Mr. AKHMAD KADYROV.

00:06:49.099 --> 00:06:51.249
So he went to him and said…

00:06:51.249 --> 00:06:52.249
‘Kadyrov, dude.

00:06:52.249 --> 00:06:56.249
Look, I’m gonna shower you in gold, and
give you as many weapons and as much power

00:06:56.249 --> 00:07:01.729
as you need… you can do whatever you want
there in Chechnya but there is only one condition:

00:07:01.729 --> 00:07:04.610
No wars and no terrorism anymore, alright?’

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:08.389
And… as we say here at VisualPolitik…
as it was said, so it was done!

00:07:08.389 --> 00:07:10.020
The war was over.

00:07:10.020 --> 00:07:15.389
And Kadyrov used all that help from the Kremlin
to destroy the other warlords in the republic.

00:07:15.389 --> 00:07:19.039
And now you might wonder…

00:07:19.039 --> 00:07:21.960
Well, did it work?

00:07:21.960 --> 00:07:27.069
Well… the answer is yes, and… no.

00:07:27.069 --> 00:07:28.869
Of course there were no more wars.

00:07:28.869 --> 00:07:34.310
But many of those other warlords started organizing
terrorist attacks in other areas of Russia,

00:07:34.310 --> 00:07:35.520
including Moscow.

00:07:35.520 --> 00:07:40.220
In the Moscow case, a terrorist group kidnapped
over 300 hostages in a theatre.

00:07:40.220 --> 00:07:41.770
Of those 300 civilians, 170 died.

00:07:41.770 --> 00:07:43.139
In other words…

00:07:43.139 --> 00:07:47.740
Putin’s plan was far from perfect.

00:07:47.740 --> 00:07:50.110
And Kadyrov’s authority was not taken for
granted.

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:54.309
In fact, some years later he would die in
another terrorist attack in Grozny.

00:07:54.309 --> 00:08:02.770
And that was the moment when the main character
of this story come into the picture…

00:08:02.770 --> 00:08:10.419
AN INSTAGRAM STAR RAMZAN KADYROV succeeded
his father in power.

00:08:10.419 --> 00:08:16.559
And he learnt a valuable lesson: if you wanna
start a dictatorship, make it big.

00:08:16.559 --> 00:08:20.990
We are talking about a country full of warlords
fighting each other, where Al Qaeda or Daesh

00:08:20.990 --> 00:08:24.039
were recruiting people who might challenge
Kadyrov’s power.

00:08:24.039 --> 00:08:27.680
In other words… he was not willing to let
those weird Western fashions, you know, like

00:08:27.680 --> 00:08:30.029
democracy or Human Rights make him look weak.

00:08:30.029 --> 00:08:33.740
Besides, he had Putin’s support, he had
wealth and he had weapons…

00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:36.970
What else coukd you ask for?

00:08:36.970 --> 00:08:40.400
“I owe my life to Putin.

00:08:40.400 --> 00:08:42.680
If I ever forget this, I am not a man.

00:08:42.680 --> 00:08:45.660
When I went through a terribly hard time in
my life, he helped.

00:08:45.660 --> 00:08:50.220
He is the most saintly man to me”—Ramzan
Kadyrov

00:08:50.220 --> 00:08:56.330
The truth is… since Kadyrov came to power,
Chechen terrorist attacks in other parts of

00:08:56.330 --> 00:08:58.160
Russia have disappeared.

00:08:58.160 --> 00:08:59.160
But not only that!

00:08:59.160 --> 00:09:02.090
Al Qaeda and Daesh militants are disappearing
too.

00:09:02.090 --> 00:09:06.820
Kadyrov’s police chases them, expels them
from the country with their families, and

00:09:06.820 --> 00:09:11.110
then burns their houses!

00:09:11.110 --> 00:09:16.690
If this was not enough, Kadyrov’s soldiers
offered themselves as volunteers for the most

00:09:16.690 --> 00:09:18.160
dangerous missions in Ukraine.

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:22.690
In fact, in order to show his love for Putin,
Ramzan Kadyrov organized a military parade

00:09:22.690 --> 00:09:24.410
at Grozny football stadium.

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:27.120
Thousands of soldiers waved at the Chechen
president.

00:09:27.120 --> 00:09:29.870
They were ready to die for him...

00:09:29.870 --> 00:09:36.830
“If Putin tells me to get my army together,
I´m ready”- Ramzan Kadyrov But things are

00:09:36.830 --> 00:09:39.320
not as sweet as they might seem.

00:09:39.320 --> 00:09:43.960
Actually, with that military parade, Kadyrov
was giving two messages: One was ‘Hey Putin,

00:09:43.960 --> 00:09:48.560
I’m your buddy’, the other was ‘Hey
Putin, if you ever stop being my buddy, come

00:09:48.560 --> 00:09:51.240
and get me… if you dare’.

00:09:51.240 --> 00:09:56.620
Yes, friends, if Vladimir Putin ever wanted
to confront his Chechen bestie, it would be

00:09:56.620 --> 00:09:58.850
complicated, to say the least...

00:09:58.850 --> 00:10:04.150
And there are many signs that this could happen.

00:10:04.150 --> 00:10:09.310
In fact, all of Kadyrov’s political foes
have been murdered, regardless of where they

00:10:09.310 --> 00:10:10.380
were.

00:10:10.380 --> 00:10:14.840
From journalists living in Moscow to political
opponents hiding in Saint Petersburg…

00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:16.360
So, what does this mean?

00:10:16.360 --> 00:10:22.200
Well, it means the Government of Grozny has
its own KGB situated all across the country.

00:10:22.200 --> 00:10:27.530
And they are happy to use it anytime someone,
Chechen or not, gets a little bothersome.

00:10:27.530 --> 00:10:33.970
To put it more poetically, Putin created Ramzan
Kadyrov, and now his creation has become big

00:10:33.970 --> 00:10:35.680
enough to look him in the eye.

00:10:35.680 --> 00:10:43.820
This explains why, unlike other presidents
of Russian republics, Kadyrov dares to give

00:10:43.820 --> 00:10:46.340
his opinion on international affairs.

00:10:46.340 --> 00:10:52.910
And the Kremlin pretends they don’t see
those horrific gay concentration camps...

00:10:52.910 --> 00:10:57.830
Russia backs Chechen government's denials
over killing and torture of gay men Meanwhile,

00:10:57.830 --> 00:11:01.340
Chechnya is getting wealthier and wealthier
thanks to Russia.

00:11:01.340 --> 00:11:05.910
90% of their wealth comes, directly, from
money transfers from the Kremlin.

00:11:05.910 --> 00:11:10.120
Kadyrov has built a republic where the cult
of his personality is almost like a second

00:11:10.120 --> 00:11:12.530
religion, just surpassed by Islam.

00:11:12.530 --> 00:11:18.910
His instagram account has over 3 million followers,
twice as much as the Chechen population.

00:11:18.910 --> 00:11:22.970
And on this account you can see the lifestyle
of one of the craziest dictators around…

00:11:22.970 --> 00:11:34.010
and, at the same time, the only one that makes
Putin afraid.

00:11:34.010 --> 00:11:35.400
So now the question is…

00:11:35.400 --> 00:11:38.050
Will Vladimir Putin and Ramzan Kadyrov end
up clashing?

00:11:38.050 --> 00:11:42.160
Should the Kremlin try to stop the Human Rights
violations in Chechnya?

